                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="42" value="Inside the db, we will often care about getting logs by pod&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- The raw, replaced file is the easiest way to do this&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- different pods will have different logging formats (ex, not replicas of the same pod)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
